# AMD64 thunk export spec -- advapi32.dll.
#
# Greedy-cover module from the 2026-08-14 triage worklist: with combase,
# ole32, advapi32, oleaut32 and gdi32 present as guest thunk builtins, 101
# more of the 344 corpus tests become loadable.  Exports the oracle refuses
# (struct-by-value, float, no declaration) are absent and bind to a named
# per-symbol sentinel -- loadability first, surface closes from the data.
DLL advapi32.dll
FROM-SPEC auto

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The 2026-08-30 Civilization VI triage
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Epic's EOSSDK-Win64-Shipping.dll -- the module Civ VI's loader dies in --
# imports the four Credential Manager entry points, and FROM-SPEC auto refused
# every one of them as "no declaration found in Wine headers".  The
# declarations exist (include/wincred.h:260 CredFree, :269 CredReadW, and the
# CredWriteW/CredDeleteW siblings); wincred.h is simply not in the oracle's
# default translation unit, the same gap winldap.h had in wldap32.thunks.
#
# One header, four real clang-checked signatures -- no assertion columns.
PROBE-EXTRA wincred.h
